What is bitcoin? Why is it so popular? And most importantly, how can you get started with this exciting new technology? In this article, we’ll answer those questions and more, so you can get your first Bitcoin today!
What Is Bitcoin? – Bitcoin Explained
Bitcoin is a digital currency that was created in 2009. It is decentralized, meaning it is not controlled by any government or central authority. Bitcoin is created and transferred using a public ledger called the blockchain. The blockchain is a shared database that is maintained by a network of computers. Transactions are verified and recorded on the blockchain, and new bitcoins are created to reward miners who verify transactions

